    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ever since you exhibited your gifts, you feel much more at home in domains that align with your drachiri benefactor. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks and to saving throws against natural effects while you are in domains or environments that align with your chosen Benefactor’s Domains, Aspects &amp; Themes. If you become a Master in Survival, the bonus to saving throws apply to even non-natural effects, and your bonus to Survival checks increase to +2.</span></p>"
